    old "Ah! I've never felt the light of Halkeginia shine this brightly before!!{#ch24_s_015}"
    new "サイト：ああっ、ハルケギニアを照らす日の光がこれほど眩しく感じたことはなかったさ！！"

    old "Are you all right, Saito-san? I have a handkerchief here… Here.{#ch24_si_014}"
